OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor pool to reopen after
OL,4,Asewage overflow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bathing pool which was closed
OL,7,Ffollowing a leak from the site's
OL,8,Ftoilets is expected to reopen.
OL,10,FThe States of Guernsey said it had been
OL,11,Fdirected by Environmental Health to
OL,12,Fclose the Ladies' Pool at La Vallette
OL,13,Fon 2 September after tests revealed
OL,14,Ffoul drainage from the toilets had been
OL,15,Ffound in public areas and the pool.
OL,17,FThe Bathing Pools, the charity which
OL,18,Foversees the site, previously said the
OL,19,Fcesspit, that served both the public
OL,20,Ftoilets and cafe had "overfilled".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
