OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor pool to reopen after
OL,4,Asewage overflow
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt announced on Friday that
OL,7,F"Environmental Health officers are
OL,8,Fsatisfied" that the public toilets and
OL,9,Fthe cafe toilets "pose no further risk
OL,10,Fto water quality at the Ladies' Pool".
OL,11,FThe pool is expected to reopen on
OL,12,FWednesday.
